sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a

    opt State is NOT EVConnectedPostSession
        Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EVConnectedPostSession
    end

    Note over CS,CSMS: Step 1: Test System notifies the CSMS about the status change of the connector
    CS->>CSMS: StatusNotificationRequest (connectorStatus = Available)
    CS->>CSMS: NotifyEventRequest (trigger = Delta, actualValue = Available, component.name = Connector, variable.name = AvailabilityState)
    CSMS-->>CS: StatusNotificationResponse / NotifyEventResponse (CSMS responds accordingly)

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (eventType = Ended, triggerReason = EVCommunicationLost, transactionInfo.chargingState = Idle, transactionInfo.stoppedReason = EVDisconnected)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post condition: State is EVDisconnected
